canonical_spec = "../../spec.kvx"
authority = "subordinate"
paragraph = "depends on T-C01/T-C02 shared package/state and core contracts: implement reward types, strict encoding and checked exact allocation in new src/reward_math.rs and the reward portion of src/rewards.rs; add A01–A05/A15 cases to new tests/rewards.rs. Compile: cargo build --manifest-path programs/Cargo.toml -p layerx-programs-ai-market --target wasm32-unknown-unknown --release. Verify: cargo test --manifest-path programs/Cargo.toml -p layerx-programs-ai-market --test rewards reward_math_and_encoding -- --exact. The named test is a future required target, not an existing command claimed to work."

