authority = "subordinate"
paragraph = "depends on F06-T03/F10 projection primitives and T-C04 platform resource prerequisite: implement finalized reward projections, client recovery and capacity preflight in the common F10-owned client paths, with F06 ownership limited to new tests/rewards_native.rs scenarios. No second writer edits F10 files. Same compile command for reward application. Verify: cargo test --manifest-path programs/Cargo.toml -p layerx-programs-ai-market --test rewards_native reward_finality_recovery_and_capacity -- --exact. Resource admission/reclamation work outside the application needs its own platform task and authority; this spec does not authorize it."

